{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15360320","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15360320","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1536032001:0":{"text":"That house. The one I'm pointing at...","source_cn":"就是……就是那间房子。对，就是我手指的那间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAE95E69E4CCF4A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1536032002:0":{"text":"The moment I got close and smelled that rot... I knew something was wrong... But I didn't expect it to be so... so...","source_cn":"刚凑近点，闻到一股子奇怪的腐臭味的时候，我就知道没好事...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x682689210A149F6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1536032003:0":{"text":"The whole place was full of bodies. Soldiers... not a single one was whole. Some were torn apart. Some had been... eaten.","source_cn":"里面全都是其他士兵的……尸体，可没有一具是完整的。有的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0690CD75C1ABA0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1536032004:0":{"text":"One was slumped by the door... holding handfuls of bug eggs...","source_cn":"有个靠着门死的士兵，他的怀里……怀里还抱着无数的虫卵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x166480F78025F645","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1536032005:1":{"text":"Stop... please stop—ugh...","source_cn":"快、快别说了……呕……","status":"mat